  - The term \( T(n-1)/2 \) represents the time taken to solve the problem for the right sub-linear (which also has \( \frac{n-1}{2} \)) elements.
- The final recursive relation \( T(n) = 2n - 1 \) is derived by combining the terms in the recursive case.

