Since 1 km = 1000000 cm, we can convert the speed to kilometers per minute:
\[ 5200 \text{ cm/minute} = \frac{5200}{1000000} \text{ km/minute} = 0.0052 \text{ km/minute} \]

The time it took Derya to get home is 20 minutes. So, the total distance to his friend's house is:
