\]

where:
- \( x(t) \) is the position of the oscillator at time \( t \)
- \( A \) is the amplitude of the oscillation
- \( \omega \) is the angular frequency of the oscillator
- \( \phi \) is the phase phase
- \( x_0 \) is the initial position of the oscillator

